# Reisebus: a modern white tour coach (w/i) with a blue swoosh S/b rising to
# the rear, dark tinted windows d with faint heads E, a raked windscreen
# with the driver, a bug-eye mirror, two k/d wheels with i hubs, headlight w
# and amber hazard lamps (o off, Y on) at both ends, wine R tail lamps.
# Faces LEFT (front = left), no mirror. Not a Postbus: never yellow, no horn.
# The roof line is flat over the whole length (the roof bounce covers it).
# idle = door open, engine running (1 px body shake, exhaust puff i/w).
# telegraph = door closed, hazard lamps blink. drive = hubs turn, 1 px bounce.
# fotostopp = stopped; frame 1 has 3 camera flashes w in different windows.
# Built with a scratch script (shapes + automatic k outline), frozen here.
sprite = reisebus
size   = 64x32
origin = 32,32
hitbox = 2,4,60,28
anim   = idle      frames=2 ticks=30 loop
anim   = telegraph frames=2 ticks=6 loop
anim   = drive     frames=2 ticks=4 loop
anim   = fotostopp frames=2 ticks=16 loop
---
